  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14194746/assets/4ede7ee4b2f41d19ba36d8e1cb28e9ab480a54c83310686baa35e7d08a7e7fd4.png)\n\nA liquid is heated to ${150}^{∘}\\text{C}$ and then left to cool. The temperature of the liquid after $t$ hours is given by $T(t).$  The graph of $T(t)$ is shown above.\n\nApproximate the rate of change of temperature when $t=2$ using a central difference approximation with step size $h=1.$",
